      "releaseNotes": "Reorder your favorite drinks and chips faster with Quick Refill, build your order before you arrive with Pre-fill Your Cart, and find menu items faster with Menu Search. We’ve also made a few behind-the-scenes improvements to keep your Topgolf experience running smoothly, including reservation editing options for Topgolf venues that provide floor choice upgrades.",
