      "description": "The Topgolf App is the best way to get into the game!\n\nPLAN YOUR VISIT\n• Reserve bays in advance\n• Edit your reservation\n• View real-time wait times\n• Explore discount offers and seasonal promotions\n• Join the waitlist remotely and skip the line\n• Load gameplay credit for faster check-in\n\nIN-BAY FEATURES\n• Order food and drinks straight to your bay‡\n• Pay your check right from your phone‡\n• Access our fun augmented reality feature\n• Capture memories with social filters\n• Sign in players\n• Browse the full menu\n• Control your bay’s TV\n\nYOUR MEMBERSHIP\n• Track game history and player stats\n• Stay up to date on events, news, and venue happenings\n• Access perks with a Topgolf PlayMore or Platinum membership\n\n———\n\nTopgolf believes in the unlimited power of play. Whether you’re connecting with friends, leveling up your swing, or just chasing a good time, the app gives you convenient features and great offers to make every visit even better.\n\n‡ Not all features are available at every venue—but the fun is! Come play around!",
